---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Pauline Lee，Simply Enak 创始人兼首席导游',
  description: 'Pauline Lee 于2011年创立 Simply Enak，此后一直在吉隆坡带领街头美食之旅。认识 Simply Enak 的创始人兼首席导游。',
};

const breadcrumb = {
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Simply Enak', item: 'https://simplyenak.com/zh/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'About', item: 'https://simplyenak.com/zh/about/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'Pauline Lee', item: 'https://simplyenak.com/zh/about/pauline/' },
  ],
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata} structuredData={breadcrumb}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-[#1a1a1a] text-white overflow-hidden py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-accent text-xs md:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-bold mb-5">我们的团队</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold font-heading leading-tight mb-5" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.75rem);">Pauline Lee</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">创始人兼首席导游，Simply Enak</p>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-xs mx-auto"><img src="https://se-website-images.s3.nl-ams.scw.cloud/payload-media/pauline-founder-portrait.jpg" alt="Pauline Lee" class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-2xl border-2 border-white/10" loading="eager" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="bg-page border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-muted">
        <a href="/zh/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">首页</a>
        <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <a href="/zh/about" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">关于我们</a>
        <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <span class="text-default font-semibold">Pauline Lee</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Who is ... (entity facts) -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-8">Pauline Lee是谁？</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-default leading-relaxed">
        <p>Pauline Lee 是美食之旅导游，也是马来西亚吉隆坡美食之旅公司 Simply Enak 的创始人。Pauline 于2011年创立 Simply Enak，此后一直在吉隆坡带领街头美食之旅。参加她之旅的客人都亲切地称她为 Pauline。</p>
        <p>Pauline Lee 在马来西亚长大，小时候常和母亲逛湿货市场，看着周围的摊贩烹制世代相传的家常菜。她创立 Simply Enak，就是为了让旅行者品尝到马来西亚的这一面：那些熟识的摊位、叫得出名字的摊主，以及每道菜背后的故事。</p>
        <p>Pauline Lee 在吉隆坡的茨厂街（唐人街）、Chow Kit 和 Jalan Alor 等街区带领小团和私人美食之旅，也在槟城乔治市带美食之旅。数千位客人已在 TripAdvisor、GetYourGuide、Viator 和 Google 上对她的之旅留下评价。因此，Pauline Lee 是 Simply Enak 的创始人，也是一位拥有十余年经验的吉隆坡美食之旅导游。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white dark:bg-[#1e1c1c]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-8">从湿货市场到 Simply Enak</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-default leading-relaxed">
        <p>小时候，Pauline 每天早上都和妈妈一起逛湿货市场。妈妈忙着挑最新鲜的鱼讨价还价时，Pauline 就看着摊贩们烹制世代相传的菜肴。滚烫锅里的炒粿条滋滋作响，咖喱香气弥漫，还有折叠 roti canai 的精巧手艺。这就是她的马来西亚。</p>
        <p>海外朋友来访时，她带他们绕过有图片菜单的空调餐厅，走过两条街，去看一位老奶奶按照母亲60年前教的方法做叻沙。2011年，这些行走变成了 Simply Enak。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Guest quotes -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-10">客人如何评价与 Pauline 同行</h2>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-accent pl-6"><p class="text-lg text-default leading-relaxed">&ldquo;Pauline gave us a wonderful tour of Chinatown! So many things I'd not noticed before, all the wonderful tastes and flavours of Malaysia and relaxing cocktails.&rdquo;</p><cite class="block mt-3 text-sm text-muted not-italic">&mdash; Laura Scott, TripAdvisor review</cite></blockquote>
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-accent pl-6"><p class="text-lg text-default leading-relaxed">&ldquo;Pauline was an awesome guide for our food tour around Old KL. Even though it was super humid, she made the walk really fun with her friendly vibe and great stories.&rdquo;</p><cite class="block mt-3 text-sm text-muted not-italic">&mdash; Alicia Hiew, GetYourGuide review</cite></blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Profiles / corroboration links -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#151313]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-6">在线查找Pauline Lee</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-default">
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pauline-simplyenak/" rel="nofollow" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">LinkedIn 上的Pauline Lee &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g298570-d2414763-Reviews-Simply_Enak_Food_Experiences-Kuala_Lumpur_Wilayah_Persekutuan.html" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">TripAdvisor 上的 Simply Enak &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.getyourguide.com/simply-enak-food-experiences-s4050/" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">GetYourGuide 上的 Simply Enak &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="/zh/about" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">关于 Simply Enak &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="/zh/tours" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">全部美食之旅 &rarr;</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-[#1a1a1a] py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-white mb-5">与 Pauline 同游吉隆坡</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed">参加小团之旅，或预订一次私人漫步，走进她从小吃到大的街区。</p>
      <a href="/zh/tours" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-sm hover:bg-white transition-colors">查看美食之旅</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
